# Add project specific R8 rules here.
# AGP will combine all keep rule files in src/main/keepRules to pass to R8
#
# For more details, see
#   https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules

# If your project uses WebView with JS, uncomment the following
# and specify the fully qualified class name to the JavaScript interface
# class:
#-keepclassmembers class fqcn.of.javascript.interface.for.webview {
#   public *;
#}

# Room 数据库实现类由 Room 运行时反射实例化（Class.forName(..._Impl).newInstance()）。
# room-runtime 2.2.5 自带的 keep 规则只保住类名（-keep class * extends RoomDatabase
# 不带成员列表），R8 会把无参构造器裁掉；WorkManager 2.7.1（经 Glance 传递引入）用
# Room 建 WorkDatabase 时随即抛 InstantiationException，表现为
# 「Failed to create an instance of androidx.work.impl.WorkDatabase」，
# InitializationProvider 初始化失败 → 进程一启动就闪退（仅在 release 出现）。
# 只需保住构造器：建库用的 createOpenHelper/createInvalidationTracker 是
# RoomDatabase.init 里的虚调用，R8 自己会保留（实测启动、建库正常）
-keep class * extends androidx.room.RoomDatabase { <init>(); }
